{{Top}}
[[File:StarCommuterShuttle-SWRebelsFB.png|thumb|right|300px|A Star Commuter 2000 shuttle]]
{{Quote|We have three ''Sheathipede''-class shuttles, but they have no weapons.|[[General]] [[Kalani]]|<ref name="The Last Battle">{{Rebels|The Last Battle}}</ref>}}
'''Shuttles''' were a type of [[starship]] used to [[transport]] personnel and cargo through space, often from one starship to another or from a ship to a [[planet]]ary body. There were a number of different types of shuttles in [[the galaxy]], including the [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[Lambda-class T-4a shuttle|''Lambda''-class T-4a shuttle]]<ref name="Episode VI">{{Film|VI}}</ref> and the civilian [[Star Commuter 2000]].<ref name="Facebook 2000">{{Facebook|username=starwarsrebels|url=starwarsrebels/photos/pb.180356405454324.-2207520000.1414501247./367182126771750|name=''[[Star Wars Rebels]]''|date=2014-10-16|quote=Piloted by RX-series droids, Star Commuter 2000's are used for travel between nearby planets.|archivedate=20151231223354}}</ref>

==History==
In [[22 BBY]], the [[Ohnaka Gang]] operated the [[Flarestar-class attack shuttle|''Flarestar''-class attack shuttle]].<ref name="ESOV">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia of Starfighters and Other Vehicles]]''</ref>

[[File:The_Emperors_Arrival_AoRCR.png|thumb|right|250px|Imperial personnel often used ''Lambda''-class shuttles.]]
The [[New Mandalorians]] operated the [[Aka'jor-class shuttle|''Aka'jor''-class shuttle]] in [[21 BBY]].<ref name="ESOV" />

In [[18 BBY]], [[Gozetta]] operated [[Gozetta's shuttle|her own]] customized shuttle craft. Around the same time, [[Rhyssa Graf|Rhyssa]] and [[Auric Graf]] operated a [[Mu-class shuttle|''Mu''-class shuttle]] in their travels around [[Wild Space]].<ref name="The Nest">''[[Adventures in Wild Space: The Nest]]''</ref>

The [[Resistance]], a paramilitary group operating 30 years after the [[Battle of Endor]], modified their own [[Resistance transport]]s.<ref name="ICS">''[[Star Wars: The Force Awakens: Incredible Cross-Sections]]''</ref> They also made use of several [[U-55 orbital loadlifter]]s.<ref name="Episode VIII">{{Film|VIII}}</ref>

The [[First Order]] also operated shuttle craft, in particular the [[Upsilon-class command shuttle|''Upsilon''-class command shuttle]] and [[Xi-class light shuttle|''Xi''-class light shuttle]].<ref name="Episode VII">{{Film|VII}}</ref>

